        <mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b style='font-size:20px'&gt;Graphify Knowledge Agent POC — architecture of the repo (poc-la-graph)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:11px'&gt;Evidence-grounded chat over documents (Graphify graph first, Haystack passages second) + read-only PL/SQL analysis console · Docker Compose runtime&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
